  "_comment": "Synthetic production-shaped creature for the Issue #1785 remove-neuron reachability characterisation (Issue #1810). Hand-authored and self-contained: 6 inputs, 36 hidden neurons in four feed-forward layers (12/10/8/3) plus 3 orphaned hidden neurons, and 2 outputs. Every weight is 1.0 and every squash IDENTITY, so each neuron's structural impact is a pure function of the topology. The hub h-b-00 carries 6 incoming and 6 outgoing synapses - the fixture's maximum degree of 12 - so its boosted removal savings at costOfGrowth=1e-7 are exactly 1.5 * 1e-7 * (1 + 12/10) = 3.3e-7. Neurons are ordered inputs, hidden layers, orphans, outputs so every synapse points forward (Issue #1184).",
